l springs with naturally heated water that provide relaxation and medicinal benefits. Average temperature is 111°F."},{"id":"marker2","name":"Valminen Spring of Life","legend":"This legendary water source is whispered about in ancient tales and believed to possess mystical properties. The spring emanates crystal-clear water, shimmering with an otherworldly iridescence that sparkles even in the dimmest light."},{"id":"marker3","name":"Tavergyar — iron mining town","legend":"Tavergyar is a mining town of 2823 people just nearby the iron mine."},{"id":"marker4","name":"Satorok — silver mining town","legend":"Satorok is a mining town of 488 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker5","name":"Rerutio Bridge","legend":"A formidable bridge spans over the Viohja River near Rerutio."},{"id":"marker6","name":"The Friendly Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled cheese with bitter kumis is served here."},{"id":"marker7","name":"Methossian Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Nilvan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker9","name":"Nangeq Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker10","name":"Collan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Skrodoyrian Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker12","name":"Deleveszalese Waterfall","legend":"The cascades of a stunning waterfall."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Vigry Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Veniverian War. \r\nDate: March 31, 249 Bland Era."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=289347215522\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=289347215522\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker15","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2893472152515\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2893472152515\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker16","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2893472152468\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=2893472152468\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker17","name":"Prested Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 38 ft long."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Vetiatuagus Banshee","legend":"Tipplers speak of a great Banshee who inhabits Vetiatuagus hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker19","name":"Alvez Mountain","legend":"A sacred mountain of Ypeqalik Deities. Height: 9216 ft."},{"id":"marker20","name":"Anbyen Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Inuk Deities."},{"id":"marker21","name":"Arunarssuarner Bears","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker22","name":"Conte Ravens","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker23","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Kjerskif Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0c\ud802𐠢\udc3f\udc08\ud802𐠤𐠷\udc2f\udc32\udc1d\udc03\udc0e \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠳\udc2f𐠝𐠟\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯 \udc2f\ud802 \ud802𐠁𐠲\udc2d\udc0c \udc10 \udc1c\udc12\ud802𐠄\udc25\udc34\udc22𐠥\udc29𐠿𐠨𐠫𐠣\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑𐠫</div>"},{"id":"marker26","name":"Blomssoq Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሰተደገበዐቀ ፐ ገነዐሠ ፐዐዐደዘከ ጸ  ነከሰፈረለፀጰኀሰ ጸጠየ ገኀጸየደጰ ፈኀለሐሀቀጠወዐኀ አ ሰሐቀየፐፐደሠተመቀጸ በአ ጸጰለጰገኀፐረየረአጠዐገፀበወሀደለሠ</div>"},{"id":"marker27","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Balveirada Archive","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker30","name":"Travelling Wonderous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wonderous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker31","name":"Valero Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of might in Valero, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Confluencan Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Confluencan, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Mantises migration","legend":"A huge group of mantises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Perculiar mirage","legend":"This perculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Abermayfinin Ravine","legend":"The Abermayfinin Ravine. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Satsurata Necropolis","legend":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths"},{"id":"marker37","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3750\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker38","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2677\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker39","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/559\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker40","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/327\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"}]
